{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Good Prospects", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "What's in Store for the Future?", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 3, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Understand actions, events, and experiences in present, past or future and in spoken or written texts and in work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands extended speeches, lectures, articles and reports of the professional, academic, or daily life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands extended speeches, lectures, articles and reports of the professional, academic, or daily life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands extended speeches, lectures, articles and reports of the professional, academic, or daily life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands extended speeches, lectures, articles and reports of the professional, academic, or daily life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands extended speeches, lectures, articles and reports of the professional, academic, or daily life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "smorgasbord", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a variety of products or services a person can choose from (originally, a large selection of food)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You could say it's a smorgasbord approach.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about future projects at work.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "quarterly", "type": "name"}, {"content": "four times a year", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Like all companies, we have monthly, quarterly, semi-annual and annual goals to meet.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "semi-annual", "type": "name"}, {"content": "two times a year", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Our semi-annual goals may be difficult to reach this year.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "e-book", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a book that is only published in electronic form", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Another area that is new for us is the publishing of e-books.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "tablet", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a small electronic device, similar to a computer, used for reading", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Many people are more comfortable reading on their computer or their tablet, rather than the printed form of a book.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "self-publishing", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the process of publishing a written work, such as a story or novel, by yourself (not through a publishing company)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We will offer training courses and workshops on self-publishing.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "shareholder", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who owns a part of a company, usually through stocks", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This helps the shareholders understand that we are continuously moving toward our long-term goal.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " <span class=\"italic\">Will </span>to Express Intention or Willingness", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you talk about intention, you express what you have in mind for a future time. <br/> When you talk about willingness, you express what you are prepared or ready to do.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">will </span>to talk about both intention and willingness. <br/> The precise meaning will vary according to the context of the conversation. It implies a voluntary action and oftentimes it is a response to a complaint or request.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">I won't be staying long</span>. (= intention not to stay long) <br/> <span class=\"italic\">I'll give you a hand with the report when I'm done this</span>. (willingness)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I will prepare a presentation about that shortly.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "In the future, we will publish more specialized books on things like gardening.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We will offer training courses and workshops on self-publishing.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Expressing Certainty: <span class=\"italic\">When </span>and <span class=\"italic\">If</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " The words <span class=\"italic\">when</span> and <span class=\"italic\">if</span> are quite different in English. You use them to qualify a condition.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "For example:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">If</span> Sarah comes to the meeting, we'll talk it over with her then.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Here, the use of <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">if</span></span> implies that the speaker is <span class=\"underline\">not sure</span> that Sarah will attend the meeting.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">When</span>  Sarah comes to the meeting, we'll talk it over with her then.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Here, the use of <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">when</span> </span>implies that the speaker is <span class=\"underline\">quite sure</span> that Sarah will be at the meeting.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "In other words, <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">when</span> </span>indicates a stronger certainty than <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">if</span></span>. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "If you express an interest, I'm sure you will be able to work in that area.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If the demand for e-books continues to grow, there will be new opportunities in areas like history or recipe books.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If you have low costs associated with the project, it will cost less.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Each person works in a different career field, like medicine (doctor or nurse), agriculture (farmer or scientist), or the airline industry (pilot or engineer).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a dialogue of 10 - 15 lines between these three people. They talk about plans for the future in their professional area.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use sentences with <span class=\"italic\">when</span> and <span class=\"italic\">if</span> to show certainty about the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use sentences with <span class=\"italic\">will</span> to show plans and intentions for the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice your dialogue with two other people.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "With your partners, discuss which career field seems the most interesting for the future.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write sentences to show certainty about the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about plans and intentions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read the dialogue aloud.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I discuss the future of different career fields.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "ha