really excited about future projects.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: What's in store for the future?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Like all companies, we have monthly, quarterly, semi-annual and annual goals to meet. This helps the shareholders understand that we are continuously moving toward our long-term goal. I will prepare a presentation about that shortly. You can help me make it look interesting.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Sure. What are your plans for the future?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: We have lots and lots of projects underway. For example, in the future, we will publish more specialized books on things like gardening. I am also very excited about our prospects in the publishing of children's books."}, {"time": "47000", "image": "engenn11le03ob02re2img06.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I would love to work on a project like that.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>:  If you expressed an interest in that, I'm sure you will be able to. Another area that is new for us is the publishing of e-books. Many people are more comfortable reading on their computer or their tablet, rather than the printed form of a book. If the demand for e-books continues to grow, there will be new opportunities in areas like history or recipe books.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: When I think of e-books, I think about self-publishing. I'd be interesting in trying that one day."}, {"time": "80000", "image": "engenn11le03ob02re2img07.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Yes, a lot of people are interested in self-publishing nowadays. We want to help them do that. We will offer training courses and workshops on self-publishing. There are many steps in the publishing process that self-publishers will need help with, so we will offer any services they may need. You could say it's a smorgasbord approach.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Are self-publishers successful?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: It depends on what you mean by successful. You may need to sell 1000 copies per year to earn back your investment. If you have low costs associated with the project, it will be less than that. Of course, many people will feel successful if they reach the final stage of publication. It's a great feeling."}]}}], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}